          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f8fbfd;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#be185d'>Study guide</div><div style='font:700 5.4cqw/1.1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Name the topic</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:1.6cqw;max-width:62cqw'>What is being learned, why, and what being done looks like.</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;max-width:62cqw'><div style='display:flex;height:1.6cqw;border-radius:9cqw;overflow:hidden;background:#e2e8f0'><div style='flex:1 0 0;background:#15803d'></div><div style='flex:1 0 0;background:#f59e0b'></div></div><div style='margin-top:1cqw;font:600 1.5cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'><span style='color:#15803d'>1 solid</span> · <span style='color:#b45309'>1 shaky</span> · 0 not yet · 2 concepts</div></div><div style='margin-top:2.2cqw;font:700 2cqw/1.4 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0369a1'>Start with A concept built on it</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>1 thing to check: A concept built on it</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0369a1;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(3,105,161,.35)'>In the order to learn them</div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2.4cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 5cqw;font:800 2.4cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#94a3b8'>1</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1;padding:1.6cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>A first concept<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1.2cqw;padding:.2cqw 1.2cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#15803d;color:#fff'>Solid</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>The thing to know first, in your own words.</div><div style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><span style='color:#4d7c0f;font:800 1.2cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase'>book</span> <b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Where to learn it</b> · a shelf, a link or a name</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2.4cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 5cqw;font:800 2.4cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0369a1'>2</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1;padding:1.6cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:.3cqw solid #0369a1'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>A concept built on it<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1.2cqw;padding:.2cqw 1.2cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#b45309;border:1px solid #b45309'>Shaky</span><span style='margin-left:1.4cqw;color:#0369a1;font:800 1.2cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase'>start here</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:italic 1.5cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#64748b;margin-top:.4cqw'>needs A first concept</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Something that needs the first one. A fact you are not sure of is marked to check.</div><div style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:italic 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#c2410c'>? What is still unclear</div></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0369a1;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(3,105,161,.35)'>Still puzzling</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.6cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#c2410c'>What is still unclear<span style='font:italic 1.5cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#64748b'> · in A concept built on it</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Where it stops making sense.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the study guide, in the order to learn, written from the cards. The Method writes it, so edit the cards and not this.",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793398054115,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
