        "memo": "The Icon: a lightbulb, for when the study guide is seen smaller than a card. The Method writes it.",
        "link": "",
        "reason": "Learning is recognised by its symbol: at the size where a card has no room for words, a lightbulb says \"something being learned\" at once, and a glyph alone is only a mark."
